    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 26 new plugins and 257 official stars, alongside the dsh 0.1.7-rc.1 pre-release; dataelement/dsh-desktop led growth at +106 stars. However, 12,749 of 15,958 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving the health score at 37 — worth watching.",
